        "code": {
          "text": "Right lateral epicondylitis"
        },
        "clinicalStatus": {
          "coding": [
            {
              "system": "http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/condition-clinical",
              "code": "active"
            }
          ]
        },
        "bodySite": [
          {
            "text": "Right lateral elbow"
          }
        ],
        "note": [
          {
            "text": "Chronic and work-aggravated. History and examination typical; no red flags, trauma, systemic or neurological symptoms. Previously assessed approximately 3 months ago as likely tennis elbow. Non-adherent to the previous conservative plan."
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-1",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-1",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Right elbow pain"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Outer right elbow pain for approximately 9–10 months; intermittent and persisting, worse over the last 2–3 months. Local lateral elbow ache with sharp pain during lifting and gripping."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-2",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-2",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Right elbow pain aggravating and relieving factors"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Worse with scanning groceries, lifting bags, pouring a kettle and gripping the steering wheel, especially with the forearm pronated. Better with rest and as-needed ibuprofen."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-3",
      "resource": {
